# Nova Cortex

Stage-one scaffold for the Nova Cortex runtime.

## Layout

- `nova/`: Python package for the Cortex core
- `pyproject.toml`: Packaging and console entrypoint configuration

## Run

From this directory, run:

```bash
python3 -m nova.main
```
